sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Student
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Api as ReviewController
  participant Service as ReviewService
  participant Enrollment as EnrollmentService
  participant Repo as ReviewRepository

  Student->>Web: Submit course review
  Web->>Api: POST /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/reviews
  Api->>Service: reviewCourse(studentId, courseId, request)
  Service->>Enrollment: Require enrolled student
  Service->>Service: Validate rating and duplicate rule
  Service->>Repo: Save or update review
  Service-->>Api: ReviewResponse
  Api-->>Web: 200 OK
  Web-->>Student: Show review state
